@title Replacing the delivery van fleet
@subtitle Diesel, hybrid or electric for Sunrise Bakery's 18 vans, for the budget meeting on 2026-11-10
@author Tomasz Wieczorek, Operations Director
@date 2026-10-17

We replace all 18 delivery vans over the next two years. This page compares the three options on five-year cost and on how they fit our routes.

kpi Recommended mixed fleet | $1,609,800 | 12 electric, 6 hybrid
kpi Saving against diesel | $316,200 | over five years | good
kpi Vans to replace | 18 | over two years

